<h2>Agile portfolio: CareConnect</h2>
<p>CareConnect puts healthcare and emergency access in one app. These five artefacts show how my team planned, built and tracked it using Scrum. Each has its evidence on the left and my reflection on the right. The full documents are in the <a href="https://github.com/NuyraSwanson/careconnect-agile-portfolio">careconnect-agile-portfolio repository</a>.</p>

<div class="board" role="navigation" aria-label="Artefacts">
<h3>Now serving: pick an artefact</h3>
<div class="tickets">
<a class="ticket" href="#a1"><b>1</b>Team Charter</a>
<a class="ticket" href="#a2"><b>2</b>User Stories</a>
<a class="ticket" href="#a3"><b>3</b>Product Backlog</a>
